Project Instructions: NovaTech Revenue Intelligence Dashboard
NovaTech Solutions is a B2B SaaS company whose revenue data lives in three separate systems: CRM deals, marketing campaigns, and support tickets. VP of Revenue Operations Sarah Chen has asked you to unify these into a single Revenue Intelligence Dashboard so her team can spot revenue trends, identify at-risk accounts, and make faster decisions.
Your workspace includes pre-indexed knowledge bases (created by the instructor), three CSV starter files, a data dictionary, a company background brief, and Sarah Chen's dashboard requirements brief. Read all three reference documents before you begin.
Building unified analytics dashboards from siloed data sources is a core responsibility for BI analysts — this project mirrors the exact workflow you would follow when joining a new team and being asked to consolidate reporting across multiple business systems.
